{"slug":"/components/rainbow-text","title":"Rainbow Text — Animated React Component — Planes","desc":"A band of rainbow light sweeps once, left to right, across a title or line of copy as it scrolls into view, and the text appears in its own color right behind…","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 py-24\"><section><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 px-4 pb-2 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Rainbow Text</h1><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span></div><div class=\"py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-background min-h-[60vh] py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 px-6 text-center py-20\"><style>@keyframes planes-rainbow-sweep{from{background-position:100% 0}to{background-position:0 0}}</style><h2 class=\"-my-[0.2em] bg-clip-text py-[0.2em] [-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent] motion-reduce:animate-none! motion-reduce:[-webkit-text-fill-color:currentColor] max-w-[18ch] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-50 text-5xl sm:text-7xl\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, currentColor 35%, #f43f5e 38%, #f59e0b 42%, #84cc16 46%, #10b981 50%, #06b6d4 54%, #6366f1 58%, #d946ef 62%, transparent 66%);background-size:300% 100%;animation:planes-rainbow-sweep 2s ease-in-out 0.2s 1 both;animation-play-state:paused\">Built to be noticed.</h2><style>@keyframes planes-rainbow-sweep{from{background-position:100% 0}to{background-position:0 0}}</style><p class=\"-my-[0.2em] bg-clip-text py-[0.2em] [-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent] motion-reduce:animate-none! motion-reduce:[-webkit-text-fill-color:currentColor] max-w-[42ch] text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, currentColor 35%, #f43f5e 38%, #f59e0b 42%, #84cc16 46%, #10b981 50%, #06b6d4 54%, #6366f1 58%, #d946ef 62%, transparent 66%);background-size:300% 100%;animation:planes-rainbow-sweep 2s ease-in-out 1.9s 1 both;animation-play-state:paused\">A single band of color passes through once, revealing the text behind it.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-4 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-foreground/50 transition-[color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97]\">Replay</button></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl space-y-16 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><section id=\"installation\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Installation</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-muted-foreground\">Requires a Planes Pro license.</span></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto pr-20 font-mono text-[12.5px] leading-6 text-foreground/90 [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\">npx shadcn add @useplanes/rainbow-text</pre></div><p class=\"-mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">Works once the<!-- --> <a class=\"text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/setup\">@useplanes registry</a> <!-- -->is set up in your project (one-time). After that, copy and run commands directly.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-5 shadow-xs sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><span class=\"flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\">Unlock with Planes Pro</p><p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">$99 once · 160 Pro components · lifetime updates.</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 self-start rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1 sm:self-auto\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay px-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground/60 shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/setup\">I have a license</a><a class=\"group inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-surface-overlay px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-foreground shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground/80 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/#pricing\">Get Pro<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"usage\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-neutral-200/60 dark:bg-white/5 p-1\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-usage\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-usage\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-md bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-neutral-800\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10\">Usage</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-props\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-props\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground/55 hover:text-foreground\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Props</span></button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-panel-usage\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_5anpfksnksdb_-tab-usage\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">import { RainbowText } from &quot;@/components/ui/RainbowText&quot;;\n\n&lt;RainbowText as=&quot;h1&quot; className=&quot;text-6xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-50&quot;&gt;\n  Built to be noticed.\n&lt;/RainbowText&gt;</code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id=\"examples\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Examples</h2><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Heading and subtitle</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Delay the subtitle so the band reaches it after it has crossed the heading.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">&lt;RainbowText as=&quot;h2&quot; className=&quot;text-5xl font-semibold&quot;&gt;Built to be noticed.&lt;/RainbowText&gt;\n&lt;RainbowText as=&quot;p&quot; delay={0.9} className=&quot;text-zinc-500&quot;&gt;Then it settles.&lt;/RainbowText&gt;</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Replay</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The sweep plays once per mount. Change the key to play it again.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">&lt;RainbowText key={run}&gt;Built to be noticed.&lt;/RainbowText&gt;\n&lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setRun((r) =&gt; r + 1)}&gt;Replay&lt;/button&gt;</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Reduced motion</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">With prefers-reduced-motion the sweep is skipped and the text is visible from the start in its normal color.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-secondary p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"relative inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors duration-150 will-change-transform hover:bg-surface-overlay/80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">&lt;RainbowText&gt;Reduced motion shows plain text.&lt;/RainbowText&gt;</code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id=\"use-cases\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Use cases</h2><ul class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Hero headline</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">One pass of color across the landing title as the page loads, then it reads as plain type.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Section opener</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">A heading that catches the eye once as the reader scrolls into the section.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Feature callout</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">One highlighted phrase inside a heading, wrapped in an inline span.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Launch announcement</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">A product name or tagline that gets a single moment of color without looping for attention.</p></li></ul></section></div><section id=\"related\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl scroll-mt-24 px-4 pb-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Related components</h2><a class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components/text\">All Text components</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/smooth-stagger-text\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted\"><img src=\"/thumbs/smooth-stagger-text.webp\" alt=\"Smooth Stagger Text preview\" width=\"960\" height=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div><div class=\"px-1.5 pb-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground p-1\">Smooth Stagger Text</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right ml-auto size-3.5 shrink-0 text-muted-for